{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/pulls/524","id":4591798233,"node_id":"PR_kwDOR-_5V88AAAABEbFH2Q","html_url":"https://github.com/derio-net/super-fr/pull/524","diff_url":"https://github.com/derio-net/super-fr/pull/524.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/derio-net/super-fr/pull/524.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/524","number":524,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(fr): archive 2026-09-20-agentic-dispatch-verb-lint (gh-428)","user":{"login":"YiannisDermitzakis","id":10046982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDQ2OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10046982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis","html_url":"https://github.com/YiannisDermitzakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Housekeeping for #513, merged and verified on `origin/main` (`fr isolation verify-merge` → *changes present, PR MERGED*).\n\n## 1. Archive\n\nMoves to `implemented/`: the plan folder, the spec, both journals (spec + plan scope), and the run cursor. Ten renames, no content edits.\n\n## 2. Matrix refs: 60 warnings → 0\n\n`fr acceptance check` was emitting **60** `spec archived — links auto-resolve; update the matrix ref when convenient` warnings across **12** archived specs, and every merged spec added more.\n\nI originally left these, calling them cosmetic and citing the acceptance-matrix rule against hand-editing `matrix.yaml`. That was wrong on both counts:\n\n- **The rule governs a row's `status`**, which none of this touches. Origin and level *paths* are not statuses.\n- **The warning is a grace period, not a resting state.** `check._resolve_ref` falls back to `archive_twin()`, warns, and asks for the ref to be updated; updating it makes the check exact again, because the path then simply exists. The fix is the one the message asks for.\n\nAnd a permanent unclearable warning is not cosmetic — it is how a check stops being read. This repo makes that argument itself: #428 rejected a warn tier for its lint because \"~240 warnings would train authors to ignore the output\". The tool's own output deserves the same standard.\n\n**How it was done safely:**\n- rewritten with `fr`'s own `fr.acceptance.model.archive_twin`, not hand-rolled path surgery;\n- only where the twin actually exists on disk — the exact condition `_resolve_ref` warns on;\n- asserted before writing that row ids, statuses and notes are byte-identical either side, so only paths moved;\n- all three committed reports regenerated with `fr acceptance report --deterministic`.\n\n**Result:** `fr acceptance check` → 174 rows OK, **exit 0, zero warnings**. `fr acceptance report --check` → in sync. `fr validate artifacts` → 33 artifacts valid. Acceptance/matrix unit tests: 233 passed.\n\n## 3. So it does not come back\n\nFiled **#528**: `fr archive` already knows which paths it moved, so it should retarget the matrix rows naming them and regenerate the reports in the same operation. Otherwise the 61st warning starts with the next merge, and \"when convenient\" is exactly why 60 accumulated.\n\n## Left untouched\n\n`fr repair` reports unresolvable File cells for `2026-05-14-spec-dispatch-bridge` and `2026-05-17-v2-bridge-cutover` — pre-existing spec-table debt, a different mechanism from the matrix refs above, and not this PR's scope.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-09-21T13:04:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T13:18:57Z","closed_at":"2026-09-21T13:18:55Z","merged_at":"2026-09-21T13:18:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"48e93517d2a2ddaa1071d9be8c11a6fb5c54bb48","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/pulls/524/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/pulls/524/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/524/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/statuses/a4a3754cb63c90685e38cef299529ea93c1c2893","head":{"label":"derio-net:chore/archive-agentic-dispatch-verb-lint","ref":"chore/archive-agentic-dispatch-verb-lint","sha":"a4a3754cb63c90685e38cef299529ea93c1c2893","user":{"login":"derio-net","id":252884407,"node_id":"O_kgDODxK1tw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252884407?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net","html_url":"https://github.com/derio-net","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derio-net/received_e